  "prefLabel": "He-C 205.05 Presiding Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 205.05 Presiding Officer. The presiding officer at a non-adjudicatory public hearing in a rulemaking proceeding shall be the commissioner or the individual designated by the commissioner to preside at the hearing.\n\nSource. #8866-A, eff 4-13-07",
